<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>The iCloud &quot;knowledge items synced&quot; banner no longer appears at the top of the workspace when project knowledge arrives from iCloud.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Memories now keep millisecond-precision timestamps. Before, a memory this Mac had just uploaded could come back from iCloud and be treated as a newer edit from another device. Memory files written with the old day-only dates still load and are upgraded the next time they&#x27;re saved.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
